---

Gomceix is a compatibility launcher. It does not contain or distribute
Minecraft or any Mojang/Microsoft asset, and it is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Mojang Studios or Microsoft. Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang
Synergies AB.

Gomceix downloads these components at runtime. Each remains under its own
licence.

- The default game engine (the GDK-Proton-xuser archive), the Xodus archive,
  the WebKitGTK runtime and the OpenSSL XCurl set are prebuilt files published
  by Wyze3306/BedrockOnLinux.
- The Xodus archive is a patched build of xodus-gaming/xodus, licensed GPL-3.0.
- GDK-Proton (Weather-OS/GDK-Proton) is downloaded only for the optional
  "proton" engine source.
- umu-launcher (Open-Wine-Components/umu-launcher).
- ProxyPass (Kas-tle/ProxyPass), for ProxyPass mode.
- The Temurin Java runtime (Adoptium), for ProxyPass mode.
- XCurl.dll and libHttpClient.GDK.dll (minecraft-linux/mcpelauncher-gdk-dependencies).
